## Development

This project uses [mise](https://mise.jdx.dev/) as the task runner. All quality gates
are accessible via `mise run <task>`. Pull request CI runs the fast quality gate and stack-specific verification.
Product routes are selected explicitly during implementation and closeout rather
than inferred from changed paths.
